### TS-01 Check-in double room on floor 3
POST http://localhost:8081/api/reception/check-in
Content-Type: application/json

{"guestName":"Diana Otayeva","roomType":"DOUBLE","nights":2,"preferredFloor":3,"proximityPreference":"LIFT"}

### TS-02 Check-out room 204
POST http://localhost:8081/api/reception/check-out/204

### TS-02 Verify housekeeping queue
GET http://localhost:8082/api/housekeeping/queue

### TS-03 Start cleaning 204
POST http://localhost:8082/api/housekeeping/rooms/204/start

### TS-03 Mark 204 clean
POST http://localhost:8082/api/housekeeping/rooms/204/clean

### TS-04 Create room service order
POST http://localhost:8083/api/room-service/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomNumber":"301","items":[{"name":"Coffee","quantity":2,"unitPrice":4.50},{"name":"Sandwich","quantity":1,"unitPrice":8.00}]}

### TS-05 Create critical maintenance issue
POST http://localhost:8084/api/maintenance/issues
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomNumber":"115","description":"Broken shower","priority":"CRITICAL"}

### TS-08 Invalid room number
POST http://localhost:8081/api/reception/check-out/999
